{{GM|$Craft|$Clothes & Equipment|$Boots & Shoes|$Leather Boots}}

Very basic armor that offers little protection. Provides no stat bonuses but has an 20%-35% [[Agility]] [[Gilding]] slot.

==How to acquire==

#Get [[Leather]] x3 and [[:Category:String|string]].
#Use recipe from craft menu.

==Quality==

Quality of leather boots = <math>\frac{_{q}Leather+_{q}String}{2}</math> and [[Softcap|softcapped]] by <math>\sqrt{Dexterity * Sewing}</math>


==Stat Formulas==

{| class="wikitable" style="text-align: center"
!Stat
!Formula
|-
|Wear
|<math>{{Quality}} * {1.5}</math>
|-
|Deflection
|<math>\sqrt{\frac{_{Quality}}{10}} * {1}</math>
|-
|Absorption
|<math>\sqrt{\frac{_{Quality}}{10}} * {3}</math>
|}

